    <summary>Provides the input event and handled state for <see cref="E:Android.Media.TV.Ads.TvAdView.UnhandledInputEvent" />.</summary>
    <remarks>
      <para>This .NET event argument type represents the input supplied to the Android unhandled-input listener. The generated listener creates the arguments with <see cref="P:Android.Media.TV.Ads.TvAdView.UnhandledInputEventEventArgs.Handled" /> set to <see langword="true" />, invokes the event handlers, and returns the final handled value.</para>
      <para>See the <format type="text/html"><a href="https://github.com/dotnet/java-interop/blob/92b5d471f1e0f6164fc332b1f661b472f5cf3aad/tools/generator/SourceWriters/InterfaceEventArgsClass.cs">.NET event argument generator</a></format> and <format type="text/html"><a href="https://github.com/dotnet/java-interop/blob/92b5d471f1e0f6164fc332b1f661b472f5cf3aad/tools/generator/SourceWriters/InterfaceEventHandlerImplClass.cs">listener event generator</a></format>.</para>
    </remarks>
